{"v":{"1":{"l":[[40012042,10.0,"c",["G938","G4672"]],[42011031,10.0,"c",["G938","G4672"]],[44008027,5.8,"c",["G938"]],[66018007,5.8,"c",["G938"]],[40001006,4.3,"c",["G4672"]],[40001007,4.3,"c",["G4672"]],[40006029,4.3,"c",["G4672"]],[42012027,4.3,"c",["G4672"]],[14009001,38.8,"s",["H2420","H7614","H5254","H4436"]],[14009003,18.4,"s",["H7614","H4436","H8010"]],[14009009,18.4,"s",["H7614","H4436","H8010"]],[14009012,18.4,"s",["H7614","H4436","H8010"]],[2017007,10.4,"s",["H5254","H8034"]],[17002022,10.2,"s",["H4436","H8034"]],[2016004,8.7,"s",["H5254","H8064"]],[11002041,8.4,"s",["H8010","H8088"]]],"w":[[22001005,2,["Aphrahat","Ephraim"],["Aphrahat: Demonstrations","Ephraim: The Pearl - Seven Hymns on the Faith"],"3.  The Queen of Sheba  was a sheep  that had come into the place of wolves; the lamp of truth did Solomon give her, who also married  her when he fell away.  She was enlightened and went away, but they were dark as their manner was."],[11005001,1,["Ambrose"],["Ambrose: Exposition of the Christian Faith"],"1. The Queen of the South, as we read in the Book of the Kings, came to hear the wisdom of Solomon.  Likewise King Hiram sent to Solomon that he might prove him.  So also your sacred Majesty, following these examples of old time, has decreed to hear my confession of faith. But I"],[23032020,1,["Gregory Nazianzen"],["Gregory Nazianzen: Select Orations"]],[23055001,1,["Gregory Nazianzen"],["Gregory Nazianzen: Select Orations"]],[29003018,1,["Gregory Nazianzen"],["Gregory Nazianzen: Select Orations"]],[40012042,1,["Gregory Nazianzen"],["Gregory Nazianzen: Select Orations"]],[43004007,1,["Gregory Nazianzen"],["Gregory Nazianzen: Select Orations"]],[44020035,1,["Gregory Nazianzen"],["Gregory Nazianzen: Select Orations"]],[10011027,1,["Irenaeus"],["Irenaeus: Against Heresies"]],[10012001,1,["Irenaeus"],["Irenaeus: Against Heresies"]]],"f":[["Aphrahat",2,["Demonstrations"],"3.  The Queen of Sheba  was a sheep  that had come into the place of wolves; the lamp of truth did Solomon give her, who also married  her when he fell away.  She was enlightened and went away, but they were dark as their manner was."],["Origen",2,["Against Celsus"],"But that the object of Christianity  is that we should become wise, can be proved not only from the ancient Jewish writings, which we also use, but especially from those which were composed after the time of Jesus, and which are believed among the Churches to be divine.  Now, in"],["Ambrose",1,["Exposition of the Christian Faith"],"1. The Queen of the South, as we read in the Book of the Kings, came to hear the wisdom of Solomon.  Likewise King Hiram sent to Solomon that he might prove him.  So also your sacred Majesty, following these examples of old time, has decreed to hear my confession of faith. But I"],["Ephraim",1,["The Pearl - Seven Hymns on the Faith"]],["Gregory Nazianzen",1,["Select Orations"]],["Irenaeus",1,["Against Heresies"]]]},"2":{"l":[[46003012,13.1,"c",["G5093","G3037","G5557"]],[66017004,13.1,"c",["G5093","G3037","G5557"]],[66018012,13.1,"c",["G5093","G3037","G5557"]],[66018016,13.1,"c",["G5093","G3037","G5557"]],[60001007,12.0,"c",["G5093","G5553","G4183"]],[44026010,10.1,"c",["G5586","G2414","G4183"]],[44025007,9.9,"c",["G926","G2414","G4183"]],[66021011,9.3,"c",["G5093","G3037"]],[14009001,52.4,"s",["H3368","H1314","H3515","H1581"]],[14009009,27.6,"s",["H3368","H1314","H68","H8010"]],[14032027,22.8,"s",["H3368","H1314","H68","H2091"]],[26027022,22.8,"s",["H3368","H1314","H68","H2091"]],[14009010,20.8,"s",["H3368","H68","H8010","H2091"]],[27011038,18.8,"s",["H3368","H68","H2091","H3513"]],[10012030,16.0,"s",["H3368","H68","H2091"]],[13020002,16.0,"s",["H3368","H68","H2091"]]]},"3":{"l":[[42008047,6.4,"c",["G518","G2990"]],[40001006,4.3,"c",["G4672"]],[40001007,4.3,"c",["G4672"]],[40006029,4.3,"c",["G4672"]],[40012042,4.3,"c",["G4672"]],[42011031,4.3,"c",["G4672"]],[42012027,4.3,"c",["G4672"]],[43010023,4.3,"c",["G4672"]],[14009002,15.2,"s",["H5956","H8010","H5046"]],[120